{
  "title": "ISic001377. Fragmentary Greek funerary inscription",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">ἐνθάδ[ε</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"ζησασ\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">ζησασ</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ἔτη</span>  <span data-text=\"ν\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ν\"><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ν</span></span>´ [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] ΥΤΟ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Victoria Fendel, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">ἐνθάδε</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <span data-text=\"ζησασ\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">ζησασ</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ἔτη</span>  <span data-text=\"ν\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ν\">ν</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span> ] ΥΤΟ [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑΔ[.</span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"ζησασ\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">ΖΗΣΑΣ</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ΕΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"ν\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ν\"><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">Ν</span></span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΥΤΟ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Victoria Fendel, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑΔΕ</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-text=\"ζησασ\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">ΖΗΣΑΣ</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ΕΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"ν\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ν\">Ν</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΥΤΟ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text after Amico and Kaibel</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"line 1\">line.1: <span>ἐνθάδ[ε Amico 1741, 277, IG XIV 558; ΕΝΘΑΚ Amico 1741, 274; ἔνθα κ[ῖτε --- CIG IV 9500</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 2\">line.2: <span>ζησας Amico, ΙG XIV 558; ζήσας [ἄμεμπτος καὶ ἄλυπος CIG IV 9500</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"lines 3-4\">lines.3-4: <span>ἔτη ν´ [---] | [---] ΥΤΟ Amico 1741, 277; ἔτη ν´ [---] | [---] ΚΤΩ Amico 1741, 274; ἔτη ν´. [τελευτᾷ τῇ πρὸ --- Ὀ]|κτω[βρίων CIG IV 9500, IG XIV 558; ἔτη ν´. [ὑπατίᾳ] | [---o]υ ΤΟ Ferrua</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>Here … having lived … 50 years …</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The funerary inscription is highly fragmentary. Amico copied it twice, with only a minor variation in line 4, failing to recognize that the two copies represented the same text. The restorations proposed by Kirchhoff (ap. CIG IV 9500) and Kaibel (ap. IG XIV 558) are based on one of the variants (Amico 1741, 274), whereas Ferrua's restoration (1983, 27 no. 91) relies on the other (Amico 1741, 277). Kirchhoff and Kaibel interpreted the last two lines as containing the formula recording the date of death, including the specification of the month (ll. 3–4: <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">τῇ πρὸ --- Ὀ]|κτω[βρίων</span>), whereas Ferrua interpreted them as preserving a consular dating formula (<span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ὑπατίᾳ --- ο]|υ</span>), suggesting that the reference was to the consulship of the emperor Honorius (404 CE).</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Amico 1741 274, 277 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186</a>  </li><li> Kirchhoff 1877 9500 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249</a>  </li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">558</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a>  </li><li> Ferrua 1982-1983 27 no.91 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001996\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001996</a>  </li><li> 1986 36.0844 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> <p>lunate sigma and the use of a supraline on numeral recorded by Amico</p> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
